https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lsr/TikTok.lsr, policy=全局出口, tag=抖音海外, enabled=true
https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lsr/AI.lsr, policy=人工智能, tag=人工智能, enabled=true
